  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of words, with or without meaning. which can be made using all the letters of the word MATHEMATICS in which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> do not come together, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2835</mn></math>",
